@startuml
title Teacher Control Layout - Components
actor Teacher
rectangle "Teacher Interface" {
  component "Team Information View" as TeamView
  component "Activity Controls" as Controls
  component "Question Progress View" as Progress
}
Teacher --> TeamView : reviews teams
Teacher --> Controls : starts / ends answering
Teacher --> Progress : reviews live progress
note right of TeamView
Leader online/offline field omitted.
Distribute available roster width by
column weights: group name/code = 2;
online count = 1; join status = 1.
Answer summary remains on its next row,
outside the weighted columns.
Do not add replacement content.
end note
note right of Controls
After start: hide both start controls;
show end control at former start-join position.
After end: keep end control visible,
but unavailable.
end note
note right of Progress
Display question tiles in rows of four.
Each tile occupies 1/4 of available width.
Leave unused slots in the final row blank.
end note
@enduml
